slightly changed and have been also updated in the new Table <xref rid="Tab1" ref-type="table">1</xref>. The results of meta-regression remained unchanged in current reserved decimal digits. Such mild changes did not cause any substantial influence to the conclusion and clinical significance of our study.<fig id="Fig1" position="float" orientation="portrait"><label>Fig. 1</label><caption><p>The risk of amputation and PAD in patients with SGLT2i treatment. <bold>a</bold> The risk of amputation in patients with SGLT2i treatment. <bold>b</bold> The risk of PAD in patients with SGLT2i treatment. <italic toggle="yes">PAD</italic> peripheral arterial disease, <italic toggle="yes">SGLT2i</italic> sodium glucose co-transporter 2 inhibitor</p></caption><graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" id="MO1" position="float" orientation="portrait" xlink:href="12933_2021_1306_Fig1_HTML.jpg"><?image-name 12933_2021_1306_Fig1_HTML.jpg?><?image-size 240733?><?image-md5 ee769e72ab9e80ca15d1c0c48fe8cc91?><?image-image-server-status LOAD_COMPLETED?><?image-original-height 2345?><?image-original-width 1960?><?image-scaled-height 938?><?image-scaled-width 784?><?image-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/532d/8191054/ee769e72ab9e/12933_2021_1306_Fig1_HTML.jpg?><?thumb-name 12933_2021_1306_Fig1_HTML.gif?><?thumb-size 14546?><?thumb-md5 ccf27c93e1c25dd3a5da21b562557bd9?><?thumb-image-server-status NEVER_LOAD?><?thumb-scaled-height 120?><?thumb-scaled-width 100?><?thumb-cloudpmc-urn urn:cdn:blobs/532d/8191054/ccf27c93e1c2/12933_2021_1306_Fig1_HTML.gif?></graphic></fig><table-wrap id="Tab1" position="float" orientation="portrait"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Risk of amputation, PAD and DF events in patients with SGLT2i treatment</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">Subgroup</th><th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">No. of participants (SGLT2i/control)</th><th align="left" colspan="1" rowspan="1">OR</th><th align="left" co